flowchart TD
    A[Weak operational state] --> B[z stays low]
    B --> C[Activation nearly cuts it]
    C --> D[Next layer barely keeps a risk signal]

    E[Borderline operational state] --> F[z rises just above the line]
    F --> G[Only a small positive value survives]
    G --> H[Next layer keeps a weak warning signal]

    I[Strong operational state] --> J[z rises clearly]
    J --> K[Activation keeps a large value]
    K --> L[Next layer keeps a strong risk-state signal]
